# Pairs with CausalOrder. Drops the floor guard: a fresh local stamp below the partition's clock
# floor is admitted, so S, which vouched for every write below the floor, passes a write the
# receiver has not had (#4586 part 1, WalClockFloorCore).
MODULE: CausalOrderFloorGuardDropped
TARGET: CausalOrder
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a silo appends a fresh write below its partition's published floor, which S already passed
PERTURBS: AuthorA

--- FIND
    /\ StampOk(p, h)
--- REPLACE
    \* MUTATION: no floor guard.
    /\ TRUE
--- END
